# 2. The actual ingest API

I'd expose:

```text
POST /api/v1/ingest
```

supporting either:

```text
multipart/form-data

video = file.mp4
manifest = {...}
```

or:

```json
{
  "asset_url": "https://...",
  "manifest": {}
}
```

For large files, preferable:

```text
POST /assets/upload-url
       ↓
signed object-store URL
       ↓
upload MP4 directly
       ↓
POST /ingest
```

So large media never needs to pass through your dashboard server.

Flow:

```text
MP4 + manifest
      │
      ↓
schema validation
      │
      ↓
checksum
      │
      ↓
ffprobe
      │
      ├── codec
      ├── resolution
      ├── fps
      ├── duration
      └── audio
      │
      ↓
object storage
      │
      ↓
canonical asset record
      │
      ↓
asset.ingested event
```

Then the factory wakes up.

